 "notes": "Interior 14 x 12 x 5 m, origin at floor centre, open side = -Y (floor continues to y=-9 so cameras have ground under them; side walls and ceiling end at y=-6). Back wall +Y: roll-up door 4.2 x 3.7 m opening at x=0 (rideau), windows at x=+-4.7. Left wall: pegboard tool wall, bench+vice, 2 red tool chests. Right wall: corrugated cladding on posts/girts, 2 steel shelving units with N2O bottles, compressor, engine hoist, charger cart. Everything outside the room is prefixed dehors_ (ground, night city backdrop with emissive_nuit, street lamps) and is excluded from tris/dims. Emissive materials: emissive_neon (12 fixtures, markers marqueur_neon_1..12), emissive_lampe (3 dome lamps, marqueur_lampe_1..3), emissive_nuit, emissive_exit, emissive_voyant, emissive_vert. No Blender lights are exported: put real lights at the markers. Other markers: marqueur_spot_pont (above lift), marqueur_spot_etabli (above bench), marqueur_dehors_porte (street glow), marqueur_lift_pivot. Imperfect: floor stains/tyre marks are one 1024 px bake over 14x12 m (soft up close); lift hoses and the hoist chain are static (do not follow lift_chariot); rideau raised beyond +3.6 m would poke through the roof slab (invisible from inside); all materials are exported doubleSided; GLB is ~28 MB (PNG textures); tools are simplified shapes (no painted outlines on the pegboard); no car in the scene (separate asset).",
